# QA-012: Cross-check chloride by gravimetry and standard addition
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaCl 0.0005mol
add v1 AgNO3 0.0012mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 NaCl 0.0005mol
add v2 CaCl2 0.0002mol
add v2 AgNO3 0.0012mol
new
new
filter v1 v3
filter v2 v4
inspect
